MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9108645f213d0bf4bb9fb2767a31c3ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: QuestStartDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _autoPlay:
  - _changesRequired:
      _primingData: []
    _knowledgeRequired: []
    _visualRequired: {fileID: 0}
    _validDuring: []
    _startingLine: 
    _dialogue:
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Is this crumbling hole to be our hiding spot?
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: There is a vast palace to play with.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: We have nary time to dally.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: Within three minutes, we must make our leave without a trace.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: On the contrary, we have endless time.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: The letter calling us has neither sender nor guidelines.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: But our prize is a pair of bejeweled rings, of exorbitant costs.
    _oneTimeOnly: 1
    _onDialogueComplete:
    - rid: 8553398294853713995
  - _changesRequired:
      _primingData: []
    _knowledgeRequired: []
    _visualRequired: {fileID: 0}
    _validDuring:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd406d1d0de7cff43984daaef2990448, type: 2}
    _startingLine: 
    _dialogue:
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Our plan a success, and yet to the start we return. Why so?
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: Because the pieces do not fit.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: Who would seek the aid of thieves if not interested in the gains we
        bring.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Perhaps a passion not in procuring jewels, but in ceasing a marriage.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Still, I know thy nature. Speculation alone brings you no rest.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Perhaps one should start by returning to and recreating the scene of
        the crime.
    _oneTimeOnly: 1
    _onDialogueComplete:
    - rid: 8553398294853713996
  - _changesRequired:
      _primingData: []
    _knowledgeRequired: []
    _visualRequired: {fileID: 0}
    _validDuring:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7387b4f03ab35fb4399e4c52f3d6aac0, type: 2}
    _startingLine: 
    _dialogue:
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: The sender has been met, and her motives understood.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: And yet, my queries are not yet settled.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: This palace is rotton throughout, and I suspect more hands are play.
    _oneTimeOnly: 1
    _onDialogueComplete:
    - rid: 8553398294853713996
  - _changesRequired:
      _primingData: []
    _knowledgeRequired: []
    _visualRequired: {fileID: 0}
    _validDuring:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: a25a32387ef4d6046972f895e36032c0, type: 2}
    _startingLine: 
    _dialogue:
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: 'The bloodless web of daggers grows still. '
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: With this many villans at play, their failure seems comical.
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: Although, the tragedy is not yet void.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Why so?
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: If Jeanne were to reveal herself after dispatching merely one ...
    - _saidByPlayer: 1
      _line: The others will complete their task.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Then perhaps, we should resolve three issues with one fell swoop.
    _oneTimeOnly: 1
    _onDialogueComplete:
    - rid: 8553398294853713996
  _allOptions: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 8553398294853713995
